# 敏感配置模板——不要直接 apply 本文件，改好后另存为 secret.yaml（已在 .gitignore 范畴外注意勿提交！）
# 或用命令行创建：
#   kubectl create secret generic tts-api-secret  --from-literal=TTS_API_KEYS=<随机密钥>
#   kubectl create secret generic tts-oss-rclone  --from-file=rclone.conf=<本地 rclone.conf>
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: tts-api-secret
type: Opaque
stringData:
  TTS_API_KEYS: change-me-to-a-random-secret
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: tts-oss-rclone
type: Opaque
stringData:
  rclone.conf: |
    [aliyun-oss]
    type = s3
    provider = Alibaba
    access_key_id = LTAI-xxxxxxxx
    secret_access_key = xxxxxxxx
    endpoint = oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com
    acl = private
